// HRESULTs returned by IDebugProgram2::Execute, Step, or Continue
// This error is returned when Execute, Step, or Continue is called on a
// program and another program in another process has a pending expression
// evaluation (and this program's process does not). That is, only
// programs in processes with pending expression evaluations can be
// continued when any expression evaluation is occurring.
